       "say": "**Test the guardrail like a classifier.** Eight labelled examples (four with private data, four without) give the confusion matrix from the classification lesson: 3 caught (**TP**), 2 false alarms (**FP**: the order and tracking numbers), 1 miss (**FN**: a street address, which no email/phone pattern can see) and 2 correct passes (**TN**). Precision is 0.6 and recall 0.75. Which error matters depends on the use: leaking private data is usually worse than over-redacting, so favour recall, accept the false alarms, and say so. Build a labelled set of real examples from your own traffic and re-run it every time a pattern changes.",
